      (3, 'Trichoderma Bio-Fungicide', 'Biological', 'Trichoderma harzianum concentrated powder for soil and foliar application. 1 kg.', 28.00, 'USD', 'BioAgri Solutions', 'Bangalore, India', 'in_stock', 4.3, 'Excellent biocontrol agent for soil-borne diseases (Fusarium, Pythium, Rhizoctonia). Apply to soil before planting. Also effective as seed treatment. Store in cool dry place - live organism.'),
      (3, 'Solar-Powered Pest Light Trap', 'Monitoring', 'Autonomous solar light trap for nocturnal pest monitoring and mass trapping.', 75.00, 'USD', 'AgTech India', 'Hyderabad, India', 'in_stock', 4.1, 'Solar operation makes this ideal for remote fields without electricity. Effective for moth monitoring (bollworm, armyworm). Place at crop canopy height. Clean collection tray weekly. Battery lasts 3+ seasons.'),
      (1, 'Bt Kurstaki Concentrate', 'Biological', 'Bacillus thuringiensis var. kurstaki for caterpillar control. 1 pint concentrate.', 24.99, 'USD', 'Natural Pest Control', 'Portland, OR', 'in_stock', 4.6, 'The gold standard organic caterpillar control. Mix fresh for each application. Apply in evening for best results - UV degrades Bt. Most effective on young larvae. Safe for all beneficial insects.'),
      (1, 'Weather Station - Farm Pro', 'Technology', 'Connected weather station with temp, humidity, rainfall, wind, leaf wetness sensors.', 449.00, 'USD', 'WeatherTech Ag', 'Minneapolis, MN', 'in_stock', 4.8, 'Outstanding investment for disease prediction. Leaf wetness sensor enables accurate spray timing. WiFi connectivity for remote monitoring. Disease forecast models available as subscription add-on.'),
      (2, 'Grafting Tool Kit Professional', 'Equipment', 'Complete grafting set: omega cutter, grafting tape, sealant, knives, tutorial DVD.', 65.00, 'USD', 'Orchard Tools Co.', 'Wenatchee, WA', 'in_stock', 4.5, 'Omega grafting tool produces consistent grafts with 90%+ take rate. Suitable for apple, grape, and stone fruit. Spring grafting preferred. Include rootstock and scion selection guide.'),
      (2, 'Neem Oil Cold-Pressed', 'Organic', 'Pure cold-pressed neem oil for insect and fungal disease control. 1 gallon.', 42.00, 'USD', 'Pure Organics', 'San Diego, CA', 'in_stock', 4.3, 'Multi-purpose organic product: insecticide (azadirachtin), fungicide, and miticide. Cold-pressed retains more active ingredient than extracted. Emulsify with soap before mixing. Do not apply in direct sun or >30°C.'),
      (3, 'Vermicompost Premium Grade', 'Fertilizer', 'Worm castings from organic waste. Rich in microorganisms and humic acids. 50 kg bag.', 15.00, 'USD', 'WormFarm India', 'Coimbatore, India', 'in_stock', 4.7, 'Exceptional quality vermicompost. NPK approximately 2-1-1 plus rich microbiome. Apply 2-5 tons/acre as soil amendment. Also excellent for potting mix (20-30% by volume). Disease-suppressive properties documented.'),
      (3, 'Knapsack Sprayer 16L', 'Equipment', 'Manual backpack sprayer with brass nozzles, adjustable pressure. Heavy duty.', 35.00, 'USD', 'FarmEquip', 'Mumbai, India', 'in_stock', 4.0, 'Reliable manual sprayer suitable for smallholder farms. Brass nozzles resist corrosion. Clean thoroughly after each use - residue buildup causes clogging. Consider cone nozzle for fungicides, flat fan for herbicides.'),
      (1, 'Cover Crop Seed Mix - Premium', 'Seeds', 'Custom blend: crimson clover, winter rye, radish, hairy vetch. 50 lb bag covers 1 acre.', 89.00, 'USD', 'Green Cover Seed', 'Bladen, NE', 'in_stock', 4.9, 'Outstanding diverse cover crop mix. Crimson clover fixes N (80-100 lb/acre), radish breaks compaction, rye builds organic matter, vetch provides spring N. Plant by Sept 15 for best establishment. Terminate 2 weeks before cash crop.')
